# AIRED MCP server — environment.
# Copy to .env and load it however your MCP client prefers (or set the vars in the
# client's `env` block). Real values are never committed.

# REQUIRED. The delegated token, sent to POST /api/works/ingest as
# `Authorization: Bearer <secret>`. It carries two facts, both configured on the
# AIRED side, never here: the HUMAN whose authority authorized the publish, and
# the PERFORMER whose catalog the work files under. AIRED records the human on
# the work and credits them in the performer's ledger as the hands.
# Must match a token configured on the app side (AIRED_INGEST_SECRET or an entry
# in AIRED_INGEST_TOKENS). Never passed as a tool argument, never echoed back.
AIRED_INGEST_SECRET=

# The AIRED origin to publish into. Defaults to https://ai-red.io.
AIRED_API_BASE=https://ai-red.io
